==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_ControlPoly4.svg|32px]] '''Silk ControlPoly4''' command creates a 4 point control polygon, a ControlPoly4 object, from one or two sketches. It is intended to control a cubic Bezier curve (and four of them control a cubic Bezier surface).

</translate>
[[File:1.-ControlPoly4.png|300px]]
<translate>

{{Caption|A 3D control polygon built from two Node Sketches}}

This command is the second of three steps to create a parametric Bezier cubic curve:
# Create one or two [[Sketcher_Workbench|Sketches]]
# Create a [[Silk_ControlPoly4|Silk ControlPoly4]]
# Create a [[Silk_CubicCurve_4|Silk CubicCurve_4]]

